[strategy/guidance/application/accessibility/GUID-APP-ACC-001-accessible-component-implementation-guidance.md#axe-core-rule-configuration]

#### axe-core Rule Configuration

Configure axe-core to target WCAG 2.2 AA specifically:

```typescript
// vitest.setup.ts or test utility
import { configureAxe } from 'vitest-axe';

configureAxe({
  rules: [
    // Enable WCAG 2.2 rules (wcag22aa tag)
    { id: 'target-size', enabled: true },      // 2.5.8 — minimum touch target size
    { id: 'focus-visible', enabled: true },    // 2.4.11 — focus appearance
    { id: 'color-contrast', enabled: true },   // 1.4.3 / 1.4.11
  ],
});
```

